            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It's a misguided feature meant to allow ctrl-v to \"paste\" on Windows. It has been deemphasized in Nvim in part to allow its use for some other purpose, e.g. showing the quickfix list or closing the current window.\n\nAnyway, not going to spend time on this.",
